 12 14  1 	0.450	2400.0    ; attaching glycerol+ester beads to hydrocarbon tails
 14 15  1      0.520    2800.0    ; to be used between R-R when one of the R beads is overmapping 5 carbons - consider if an alternative mapping is more appropiate!
 15 16  1      0.500    2800.0    ; at the end of the chain, internal conformations in AA reference results in a longer bond on average
